<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://www.relay.fm/focused/267">On this episode of <em>Focused</em></a>, Mike and I review Q3 and talk through our plans for the rest of the year. We look at keeping a menu of opportunities without turning every interesting idea into a commitment, and setting quarterly milestones for projects that won&#8217;t fit into twelve weeks.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We also compare notes on what we&#8217;re choosing to leave undone. There&#8217;s an overhead audit, a little forgiveness for plans that changed, and a new creative challenge for each of us.</p>



